00:16:49,600 --> 00:16:51,150
就赏个脸跟我们共进晚餐吧
we'd love to take you guys to dinner.

361
00:16:51,150 --> 00:16:53,060
对  去哪儿吃都行
Yeah. Anywhere you want.

362
00:16:53,060 --> 00:16:55,070
谢谢你们的坦诚
Well, thank you for being honest.

363
00:16:55,070 --> 00:16:56,730
对  我本来想发火的
Yeah. You know, I want to be upset,

364
00:16:56,730 --> 00:16:58,900
但我们做原型的确做得挺开心的
but we did kind of have fun working on the prototype.

365
00:16:58,900 --> 00:17:01,850
别原谅他们  保持你们的怒气
Don't forgive them! Stay mad at them!

366
00:17:03,090 --> 00:17:04,760
他在里面干嘛呢
What is he doing in there?

367
00:17:04,760 --> 00:17:07,040
抓到你们咯
Busting you!

368
00:17:08,750 --> 00:17:10,300
没关系  他们道歉了
It's okay. They apologized.

369
00:17:10,300 --> 00:17:12,110
对  没事了
Yeah, it's fine.

370
00:17:12,110 --> 00:17:15,860
这结局略显平淡啊
Well this is kind of anti-climactic.

371
00:17:16,340 --> 00:17:18,300
你知道什么结局不平淡吗
You know what wasn't anti-climactic?

372
00:17:18,300 --> 00:17:19,690
那电影的结局  听好了
The end of the movie. Get this.

373
00:17:19,690 --> 00:17:21,900
不要剧透  不要剧透
No spoilers! No spoilers!

374
00:17:22,900 --> 00:17:25,840
他又"进柜"了
And he's back in the closet.

375
00:17:27,510 --> 00:17:28,430
去吃晚餐吧
Ready for dinner?

376
00:17:28,430 --> 00:17:29,570
好呀
Yeah.

377
00:17:33,290 --> 00:17:34,710
我们要不要叫上拉杰啊
Should we invite Raj?

378
00:17:34,710 --> 00:17:36,940
要
Yes.

379
00:17:39,690 --> 00:17:42,330
这事没有人知道吗
So, no one else knows about this?

380
00:17:42,330 --> 00:17:44,770
只有你
Only you.

381
00:17:45,820 --> 00:17:48,380
谢谢你信任我
Thank you for trusting me.

382
00:17:48,380 --> 00:17:49,720
有女朋友的好处就是
What good is having a girlfriend

383
00:17:49,720 --> 00:17:54,130
可以把自己的心理垃圾扔给她啊
if you can't unload your psychological sewage on her?

384
00:17:54,400 --> 00:17:57,440
没错  我就是你的情绪茅坑
That's me, your emotional outhouse.

385
00:17:59,590 --> 00:18:01,160
知道吗
You know,

386
00:18:01,160 --> 00:18:03,790
如果某天你决定要处理这些东西
if you ever decide you want to do something about this,

387
00:18:03,790 --> 00:18:05,790
我会陪着你
I'm-I'm here for you.

388
00:18:05,790 --> 00:18:07,760
谢谢你
Thank you.

389
00:18:08,040 --> 00:18:11,150
我都不知道从哪下手好
I wouldn't even know how to begin.

390
00:18:11,600 --> 00:18:13,850
一点点来吧
Baby steps, I guess.

391
00:18:21,780 --> 00:18:25,800
我可以先试着把这高尔夫球扔掉
I suppose I could try getting rid of the golf ball.

392
00:18:25,800 --> 00:18:28,150
好呀
Oh. Okay.

393
00:18:28,680 --> 00:18:32,440
反正我脑袋上自带纪念"坑"了
I will always have the dent to remember it by.

394
00:18:47,400 --> 00:18:49,120
你做到了
You did it.

395
00:18:49,590 --> 00:18:51,850
感觉还好吗
Do you feel okay?

396
00:18:52,900 --> 00:18:54,910
其实还可以
Actually, yes.

397
00:18:55,260 --> 00:18:56,880
真的
I do.

398
00:18:57,930 --> 00:19:00,100
我为你感到骄傲
Well, I'm proud of you.

399
00:19:00,720 --> 00:19:02,430
谢谢
Oh. Thanks.

400
00:19:16,460 --> 00:19:19,800
我很高兴把储藏仓库的事告诉了你
I'm glad I told you about the storage unit.

401
00:19:19,800 --> 00:19:22,190
我现在感觉跟你更亲近了
Well, I feel closer to you now.

402
00:19:22,190 --> 00:19:24,710
我也感觉跟你更亲近了
Oh, I feel closer to you, too.

403
00:19:24,710 --> 00:19:25,940
话说
You know,

404
00:19:25,940 --> 00:19:29,150
距离我上床睡觉的时间  还有几个小时呢
it's still a couple of hours until my bedtime.

405
00:19:36,040 --> 00:19:38,740
你有什么想法吗
What did you have in mind?

406
00:19:38,740 --> 00:19:42,070
你的容颜太惊人了
You look amazing.

407
00:19:45,100 --> 00:19:49,990
这个分辨率  我跟你讲  绝了
I mean, this resolution is remarkable.

408
00:19:50,640 --> 00:19:53,980
有必要为了这事赶我回家吗
I really had to go home for this?

409
00:19:53,980 --> 00:19:57,860
有啊  感觉就像你就在我房里一样
Yes, but it's like you're right here in the room.

410
00:19:57,860 --> 00:20:01,010
可是我并不在
And yet, I'm not.

411
00:20:01,010 --> 00:20:04,970
感觉我一伸手就能碰到你
But I feel like I could reach out and touch you.

412
00:20:04,970 --> 00:20:07,740
可是你并不能
And yet, you can't.

413
00:20:08,850 --> 00:20:11,360
就是说啊
I know!

